     "nodeId": "p10-rule-completion",
     "replacement": "To expand $(x+\\alpha)(x+\\beta)$, where $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ are numbers,\n\nthe coefficient of $x$ is [[$\\alpha+\\beta$|18]] and the constant term is [[$\\alpha\\beta$|18]]",
