     "replacement": "To **factorise** a monic quadratic trinomial $x^2+bx+c$:\n\n1. **P** (product): write down $c$.\n2. **S** (sum): write down $b$.\n3. **F** (factors): find two numbers $\\alpha$ and $\\beta$ with product $c$ and sum $b$.\n4. Write $x^2+bx+c=(x+\\alpha)(x+\\beta)$.",
